tha yeh zainab ka bayan aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
tujh ko dhundoon mein kahan aye mere mazloom<br>
hussain<br>
<br>
1. aakhri saans talak saath rahi tashnalabi<br>
khushq the hount tere aur zuban sukhi huwi<br>
aye zameen ta ba falak teri nigahon mein rahi<br>
tashnagi ban ke dhuwan aye mere mazloom<br>
hussain<br>
<br>
2. dhoop mein tujhko kabhi maa ne nikalne na diya<br>
apni chadar ka sada sar pe tere saya kiya<br>
khoon mein duba huwa ab tera be sar laasha<br>
hai sare reg e tapan aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
3. kanpi maqtal ki zameen aur falak tharraye<br>
amibiya-o-malak-o-jin-o-bashar rone lage<br>
ya ali kehke jo seene se ali akber ke<br>
tumne khainchi hain sina aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
4. chayi is tarha kizah koi gule tar na raha<br>
qasim-o-aun-o-muhammed ali akber na raha<br>
jo tha parde ka mohafiz wo baradar na raha<br>
hein haram nauha kuna aye mere mazloom<br>
hussain<br>
<br>
5. roze ashoor se har waqt main aazaar mein hoon<br>
aur rasan basta kabhi kocha-o-bazaar mein hoon<br>
kaisa andher hain mein shaam ke darbar mein hoon<br>
lab pa hain aaho fughan aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
6. qabr zindan mein sakina ki bana aayi hoon<br>
taziyanoo ki aziyat bhi utha aayi hoon<br>
reesma zulm ke baazu pa bandha ayi hoon<br>
dekho baazo ke nashan aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
7. meri ankhon mein abhi tak hain manazir sare<br>
tune ek din mein uthaye hain sabhi ke laashe<br>
laash ko teri uthaya na koi maqtal se<br>
dil pa chalti hain sina aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
8. roz-e-ashoor thi har lamha qayamat barpa<br>
khoon rulata tha guzarta huwa har ek lamha<br>
itna roya ke kaha tune khatilul abara<br>
yaad hain tera bayan aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
9. baad besheer ke badhta gaya tanhayee ka gham<br>
paas koi bhi na tha tere ba juzz ranjo alam<br>
auw samay tum be ghareebin ki sada se payham<br>
teri ghurbat hain ayan aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
10. shaam-e-gham chagaye umeed sahar tooth gayi<br>
jo muhafiz tha haram ki wo sipar tooth gayi<br>
haath ghazi ke kate teri kamar tooth gayi<br>
ab nahi tujh ko amman aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
11. kab talak ranjo musibat mein rahoon mein bolo<br>
apni humsheer ka ahwal zara dekh to lo<br>
aise zindaan mein hoon khaid jaha par din ko<br>
shab ka hota hain gumah aye mere mazloom hussain<br>
<br>
12. dil se razvi bhi hain pushtaini azadar tera<br>
aur har waqt wo karta hai tera ghum barpa<br>
nouha khawni ka sharaf bhi usse tune baksha<br>
uski urfat hai ayan aye mere mazloom hussain